{"4333640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "OUTBREAK FALL: BIOHAZARD", "steam_appid": 4333640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two years ago, humanity lost control.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What began as a medical breakthrough became a global disaster. A doctor’s experiments escaped containment, unleashing a plague that twisted the dead into zombies and created terrifying mutant monsters. Cities fell, society collapsed, and the world was left in ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two years later, you are among the <strong>last survivors</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>wave-based zombie shooter</strong>, you must endure endless enemy assaults in a hostile post-apocalyptic world. Survival is not only about firepower — it’s about preparation, positioning, and using the environment to your advantage as the threat grows stronger with you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A post-apocalyptic setting shaped by failed experiments and uncontrolled mutations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 unique maps</strong>, each featuring strategic locations and defensive positions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cinematic <strong>intro cutscene</strong> that introduces the outbreak</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333640/extras/17afa2963eda372856899b77496846a1.poster.avif?t=1779879149\" width=900 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333640/extras/17afa2963eda372856899b77496846a1.webm?t=1779879149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333640/extras/17afa2963eda372856899b77496846a1.mp4?t=1779879149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat &amp; Survival</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced <strong>wave-based combat</strong> with escalating intensity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic difficulty scaling</strong> based on player level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>24 enemy types</strong>, including zombies and mutant creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental interaction:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place <strong>mines</strong> at key locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger <strong>explosive barrels</strong> to control enemy waves<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333640/extras/a1f33044875f2843a92e4a2e17574a4b.poster.avif?t=1779879149\" width=976 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333640/extras/a1f33044875f2843a92e4a2e17574a4b.webm?t=1779879149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333640/extras/a1f33044875f2843a92e4a2e17574a4b.mp4?t=1779879149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipment &amp; Customization</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 weapons</strong> for different combat styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 combat suits</strong>, each offering unique bonuses</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 suits feature health regeneration</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonuses to health and movement speed allow flexible playstyles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.s